window.products.push({"id":693041,"name":"Plastic Cutting Boards for Kitchen, 5 Pieces Dishwasher Safe Cutting Board Set, Durable, Non-Slip, BPA-Free Cutting Board, Knife Friendly Chopping Boa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Op37ukrTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. COMPLETE CUTTING BOARD SET: With three different sizes of cutting boards (big, medium, and small), a paring knife, and a peeler, this cutting boards for kitchen has everything you need for your food preparation needs. The paring knife included in the cutting board set has a 4-inch blade, and is ideal for peeling and slicing small fruits and vegetables, as well as for other precision tasks. The peeler is perfect for removing the skin from fruits and vegetables quickly and easily. 2. PREMIUM MATERIALS: The plastic cutting boards for kitchen are made from food-grade PP material, which is durable and long-lasting. The material is also gentle on paring knife, preventing them from getting dull quickly. The paring knife and peeler are made of high-quality German stainless steel, which is rust-resistant and easy to clean. 3. MULTI-FUNCTIONAL DESIGN: The cutting boards are designed to be used for different purposes, The small cutting board is perfect for cutting fruits and vegetables, the medium cutting board is great for meat and poultry, while the large cutting board is ideal for cutting larger ingredients like watermelon and cabbage. The paring knife is perfect for precision cutting, while the peeler is great for removing skin from fruits and vegetables. 4. Easy to clean and store: The dishwasher safe cutting board, paring knife, and peeler are easy to clean and store. Simply rinse them with water and soap, and they're ready to use again. The chopping boards are lightweight and compact, making them easy to store in your kitchen drawer or cabinet. The paring knife also come with protective covers to keep them safe and secure when not in use. Besides, All of the pieces in the plastic cutting board set are dishwasher safe, making them easy to clean and maintain. 5. WHAT YOU GOT: 1pcs large cutting board, 1pcs medium cutting board, 1pcs small cutting board, 1pcs paring knife, 1pcs vegetable peeler. This plastic cutting boards for kitchen is a versatile, convenient, durable, and safe option for anyone who enjoys cooking or wants to upgrade their kitchen tools. This kitchen cutting board is perfect for everyday use, and the variety of sizes and tools included makes it easy to tackle any kitchen task with ease.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Op37ukrTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MONGSEW","source_asin":"B0BYMXMPND","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-693041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYMXMPND","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYMXMPND","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
