window.products.push({"id":693047,"name":"Cayway 15 PCS Artificial Succulent Plants, Fake Succulent Purple Unpotted Faux Succulent Assortment in Flocked Blue in Different Type for Birthday Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813LsjRygAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Let your imagination run free and transform your succulent craft ideas into a modern and elegant flower arrangement for your indoor or outdoor space. Various Usage: To decorate a wreath, a planter, a terrarium, or simply use in individual decorative mini pots, wedding bouquets, and as a unique accent to floral arrangements, and also for wedding, showers, dinner parties, bridal bouquets. If you don't have time to care for real ones, then our pack of 24 mini artificial succulent plant stems with a realistic look are perfect for you. Specification: Material: Plastic with flocking coating or soft latex Size: please refer to the picture. Color: purple Package includes: 15 x Mixed plastic succulents NOTE: Suitable for interior decoration, please do not leave it outdoors for a long time, the wind and sunlight may make it fade. Due to long-term transportation and squeezing, the plant may be slightly deformed, and it will recover after a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813LsjRygAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cayway","source_asin":"B0B8VPL1XL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-693047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8VPL1XL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8VPL1XL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":693048,"name":"Trout Fish Silver Toned 8 x 8 Hand-Cast Aluminum Trivet With Rubber Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PbY+GVe9L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"For more than 20 years, DEMDACO has designed and sold giftable products intended to “Lift the Spirit”—in times of celebration, when comfort is needed, or just to put a smile on someone’s face. The hand-curated artisan gifts it develops and distributes are chosen for their potential to help people nurture goodness in the lives of others, celebrate family and friends, and encourage people to treat themselves. We partner with artists representing a wide range of styles and mediums, and whose work is consistent with our values. Products are curated through this filter, then carefully reproduced by skilled craftspeople around the world. Under the DEMDACO brand, product categories include Gifts, Home Décor, Entertaining, Fashion, Baby, Holiday, and Outdoors. DEMDACO also maintains a partnership with artist Susan Lordi, offering her popular Willow Tree sculptures. Rainbow Trout Trivet is a wonderful addition to the kitchen décor of your cabin, lake house, or country home. The sculpted details of the original carving are showcased in this functional piece of art. Make a statement of a favorite pastime spent outdoors. Made of hand-cast high quality aluminum in beautiful patinas with the details of the artist's original hand-carved design. Wipe with damp cloth to clean. Features rubber feet to stabilize trivet and protect surfaces. Measures approximately 8 inches in diameter and approximately 1 inch tall. Expressing a love for the spirit of the wild is easy with this stunning piece. Perfect for an inspirational display or functional use in the kitchen. Perfect for your cabin or lake house décor. Great gift idea for the fisherman. Perfect gift for housewarming, wedding, or bridal shower. Give this beautiful décor item as a gift to the fisherman in your life, or use it in your own home to bring the joy of fishing into your kitchen. From Gallery Entertaining Collection. Ships in protective packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PbY+GVe9L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEMDACO","source_asin":"B074DP1ZLB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-693048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074DP1ZLB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074DP1ZLB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
