window.products.push({"id":693115,"name":"16 Colors USB Fairy String Lights, with Battery Powered Options Remote Control Fairy Lights 32.8 FT 100Leds Color Changing Firefly Lights with 4 Light","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812kuNtRCMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Battery and USB Powered Options: Dual power supply: 3 AA battery or USB powered remote fairy lights. The micro-USB design on the battery box makes it possible to power your lights with either batteries or a USB. Use 3Pcs AA batteries when there's no outlet. Simply connect to a USB socket or power bank to light it up if no batteries available. Upgraded 4-Wires RGB String Light: This led fairy light contains 4 wires, which is more durable than the normal 2-wire lights, feel free to shape it as you want and the wire will not get broken easily. There are 16 lighting colors and 4 flashing modes(strobe, fade, flash, smooth), with which you can create much more themes & scenarios for your bedroom, Christmas tree, balcony, garden, party, wedding, celebrations, etc. 28-Key Remote Control with Timer: Each pack of our USB fairy light comes with remote control, you can easily turn on/off the lights, change the colors, flashing modes, and set the timer with just a touch of the button. The remote control adopts Infrared technology, which allows you to control it up to 26ft far away. You can just stay indoors and control the light placed in your garden or other places! IP65 Waterproof & Decorative Wire Lights: The USB fairy string lights are waterproof except for the USB interface , so you can feel free to use it outdoors without worrying about the rain. Each pack is 32.8ft long, which make sure the wire is long enough to wrap around your trees, decorating your gazebo, patios and etc. It’s gonna take on bright and colorful effects absolutely. Wide Applications: These battery string lights make it perfect for indoor and outdoor decorations, the lights are light-weight and easy to install, suitable for garden, camping, balcony, outdoor party, Halloween, Christmas tree, etc. Gonna create a festive, lovely, soft or romantic atmosphere!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812kuNtRCMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLODD","source_asin":"B094X63HTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-693115","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094X63HTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094X63HTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
