window.products.push({"id":693158,"name":"Buddha4all Set of 4 Ceremonial 6\" Viking Drinking Horn Mug ale Beer Wine Gift Cup – Authentic Medieval Inspired Vessel with Food Safe Coating for Beer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bwxkB4DIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AUTHENTIC VIKING FEEL: If there would ever be a Viking Drink Horn to be used in shows like \"Vikings\", then THIS WOULD BE IT. You can now enjoy the authentic design and feeling of drinking beer like a proper Viking or a Fearless Norse Warrior! Made from a solid piece of horn, it will feel just right in your hands and we GUARANTEE you won't go back to drinking beer any other way. Our Viking drinking horn cups have a capacity of 200 ml to 250 ml . Since each horn cup is handcrafted, the capacity might vary slightly. This means that you can watch your favorite shows like Game of Thrones or feast like a proper Viking while drinking a manly chunk of ale or beer with our beer mug like with any good pewter or copper mug! EACH HORN MUG A UNIQUE PIECE OF ART: Each of our Viking drink horn tankards is made of an ox horn by hand while listening to Viking metal and singing praises to Thor. Each one of our horn mugs is 100% unique, no two alike! Each horn cup is also unique in color and shape and features. This means your purchase will grant you a horn cup you can truly call your own and take pride that is one of a kind! THE PERFECT GIFT We KNOW that you know someone who sports the Viking beard or maybe is covered in Viking tattoos, or is crazy about cool & classy Medieval Stuff! This makes it a perfect and unique gifting opportunity for everyone who likes to drink beer like a true Viking, and enjoy a horn mug stein that they can call truly their own.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bwxkB4DIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Buddha4all","source_asin":"B07GTBBL18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-693158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GTBBL18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GTBBL18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
