window.products.push({"id":693183,"name":"ALTGLAS Stainless Steel Soap Pump 'Zagreb' as Replacement for Liquid Hand Soap Dispensers and Bottle Upcycling (Silver Chrome) - Fits e.g. Jack Bottle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PIYAkbrIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOAP DISPENSER REPLACEMENT PUMP Ø 1.1 in: Fits on many regular mouth bottles and soap dispensers as a soap pump replacement and on all bottles with a 28-400 thread of 1.1 in / 28 mm - e.g. Boston Round bottle, Jack (35cl + 70cl), Bombay (35cl + 50cl) and many others. Have a look at the product description below to see the full list of compatible bottles. 304 STAINLESS STEEL: Our dispenser pump heads are coated with durable 304 stainless steel. The coating makes them corrosion resistant and rust-proof. Chose from a variety of colours and finishes to match the style of your chosen bottle for your DIY upcycling project. TUBE LENGTH 8 in / 20 cm: Included is a tube with 8 in / 20 cm in length that can be cut to the desired length with scissors. Make sure to cut the tube at an angle, so the part pointing downwards retains its suction strength. FREE DIY UPCYCLING EBOOK: With every pump comes an ebook on how to build your own DIY upcycling soap dispenser from empty bottles. This manual will help you realize your own upcycling project and show you how to use the dispenser pumps in the correct way. PLASTIC-FREE PACKAGING: We have removed all plastic from our product packaging and only use paper and card printed in black ink instead of 4-color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PIYAkbrIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Altglas","source_asin":"B08T6QGY9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-693183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T6QGY9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T6QGY9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
