window.products.push({"id":693652,"name":"Hamilton Beach 24708 Toastation 4-Slice Toaster and Oven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wcdWkrW9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Save on counter space with this two-in-one appliance. The unit functions as both a traditional toaster and as a toaster oven. As a toaster, it provides two 1-1/2-inch-wide toasting slots that can fit up to four slices of bread, four frozen waffles, or the halves of two bagels or English muffins. Simply drop in the item to be toasted, adjust the shade setting by turning the control knob, and push down the lever on the side for the toaster. A convenient \"cancel\" button stops the toasting at any time. Easily switch from the toaster function to the oven by sliding the lever on the front of the unit. This will seal the toaster slot and trap in the heat. The oven provides a temperature-control knob for just the right amount of heat, and its spacious interior will accommodate chicken nuggets, French fries, or even a 9-inch pizza. Other thoughtful details include automatic shutoff for safety, a \"ready\" signal, and a removable crumb tray for quick cleanup. With its sleek, stylish look in a compact design, the four-slice toaster and oven combination unit measures 17-1/2 by 14-3/5 by 9-2/7 inches and carries a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wcdWkrW9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B000R8C7NS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-693652","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000R8C7NS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000R8C7NS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
