window.products.push({"id":693855,"name":"Adela Dorm Home Bunk Bed Curtains Breathable Dustproof Single Sleeper Bed Canopy Blackout Cloth Curtain (Style 4, 1.5 2m (3 pcs))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jny9petML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Material: 100% Polyester.Feature: breathable, wear-resistant, durable for ling time use.Package Includes: 1*Bed curtain+ string+hanging hooks./2*Bed curtain+1*top +string+hanging hooks.Sensitive to light when you sleep. Black out the world with the Perfect Roommate---Bunk Bed Curtain.Simply hang the Black Out Canopy and you have an instant room, for a work desk, office, TV, work out place, privacy,etc.Suitable for indoor, students dormitory, single sleeper. In view of the customer has a lot of questions about the bed curtain.Here are some questions about the customer.and then If you have any questions about the product. Welcome to ask questions . Question: How do you install the rings of the curtain to the top bunk bed? I see the string but are there. Where do I purchase poles from since they aren’t included with the item? Answer: (1) For top bunk bed, you will need to prepare the frame by yourself, the rod is not included for it is unsafe to ship it abroad.customers who install upper bunk beds can buy brackets or sticky hooks. (2 )The other way is to use sticky hooks, you fix the sticky hooks to the wall around, and then tie the strings to it and hook the curtain, or you can buy the support rod from local shop or from Amazon. (3) It is more convenient for bottom bunk actually. bottom bunk don't need brackets because we have hooks and ropes, We just used a knot on each end to tie each end of the string to the bunk frame.(4 )You can search for: Bed curtain bracket or Curtain Rod Ceiling-Mount Bracket.There are sticks at home, and poles for drying clothes can also be used Question: Does it zip?Will the thickness of one piece of fabric block the light or is it see-through like mosquito netting (ie: mesh)? Answer: No it don't zip. and then It is not mesh, it is polyester fabric, not see through, it can block the light, but not totally black out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jny9petML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adela Boutique","source_asin":"B07V37QL9Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-693855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V37QL9Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V37QL9Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
