window.products.push({"id":693918,"name":"Charcuterie Boards innhom Cheese Board 16 × 13 inches Large Charcuterie Board Set Bamboo Cheese Board and Knife Set, Perfect House Warming Gifts New H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pdNiJWOQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧀100% FOOD-SAFE & FSC CERTIFIED🧀 innhom Charcuterie Boards are handcrafted from all-natural, organic, and sustainable bamboo, which makes it 100% food-safe, formaldehyde-free, BPA-free, with no toxins or chemicals added. Bamboo is earth friendly, properly sourced, and highly renewable. It's nonporous and resists liquid so it won't bend, warp, crack, absorb odor, or stain. This cheese board is super easy to clean and very durable. 🧀PERFECT GIFT IDEA COMES IN AN ELEGANT BOX🧀 innhom all-in-one large cheese board set is extremely versatile. It can be used as charcuterie boards, a serving tray, or a cutting board. Great birthday gifts for women, house warming gifts for new home or wedding gifts/anniversary gift for couple. Everyone will love and appreciate this thoughtful and functional gift. 🧀16 x 13 INCHES LARGE CHEESE BOARD WITH 12 INCHES PIZZA PEEL🧀 The large cheese cutting board serve multiple fine cheese and charcuterie delicacies, which measures 16 x 13 inches. Edged rims to hold crackers, cookies and nuts. Come with 2 magnet hidden serving trays, stored 4 stainless steel cheese knives which is made of bamboo handles and easy to grip. 4 non-slip feet to keep board in place and elevates it for easy pick up. Presant a 12 inches double-sided usable pizza peel. 🧀IDEAL CHOICE FOR EVERY OCCASION🧀 Designed for versatile use, the charcuterie board set for parties are perfect for every occasion - a charcuterie board for a picnic, a serving board for your wine and cheese night, or a cutting board for daily life. innhom cheese board and knife set is not only a good serving tool but also a beautiful decoration. Welcome guests with a beautiful cheese serving board filled with a colorful and tasty array of appetizing offerings. 🧀EASY TO CLEAN & MAINTAIN WITH 1 YEAR WARRANTY🧀 The surface resists oils, stains and doesn’t absorb odors. Hand-wash the charcuterie board set with mild soap and warm water. Make sure not to submerge your cheese board in water or place under the sunlight to prevent warping and cracking. Just wipe it down with a damp cloth for fast and easy clean-up! Do not bleach or put your bamboo cheese board in the dishwasher. We offer a 1 Year Warranty, any problems with the product, feel free to contact.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pdNiJWOQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"innhom","source_asin":"B09NNL443T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-693918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NNL443T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NNL443T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
